==German==

===Alternative form===
* {{l|de|Silberfisch}} {{q|fairly rare}}

===Etymology===
Mid-19th century, from {{com|de|Silber|t1=silver|Fischchen|lit2=little fish}}, which latter had already been used in this sense on its own. As in {{m+|en|silverfish}}, the name is based on the somewhat fish-like form as well as movement of the insect.

